cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "FerroFED"
abstract: >-
  A pure-Rust openEHR federation gateway: a transparent ITS-REST
  intermediary that resolves the patient outside AQL, sends standard AQL to
  each node scoped to that node's own EHR id, and merges the answers with
  per-node provenance, after the openEHR Federation Tier with AQL
  specification.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ruben
    family-names: Talstra
license: BUSL-1.1
repository-code: "https://github.com/rubentalstra/FerroFED"
url: "https://ferrofed.eu"
keywords:
  - openEHR
  - AQL
  - federation
  - ITS-REST
  - IHE
  - Rust
version: 0.0.1
date-released: 2026-10-01
